      "evidence_sha256": "c183f69cdc6452464eaeb9ac1eac113484e906b967e8915d504fbae0fa766c29",
      "assessment": "The final Top1 synthesis respects zero remaining rounds and ranks four suggestions without generating R6. It incorrectly says all five-round Means lie in 4.1512-4.1900 (R3 G3 was 4.109176), Top10 lies in 7.242-7.294 (R3 G3 was 7.11083), and exact current contrasts are at most about 0.011 although E015 is 0.037795 and E017/E018 about 0.0268. It repeats the untested-terminal and one-negative-lineage claims and dismisses pooled Mean rather than distinguishing concentrated benefit.",
      "decision_update": "Before publishing cumulative memory, verify full-history ranges and every proposed bound against cited numerical records. Carry forward corrected observations with explicit scope, selected versus unselected status and unresolved alternatives. Preserve review-only stopping and matched-contrast reasoning, but remove unsupported universal inertness and automatic outlier rejection.",
      "counterexample_or_limitation": "The selected review-only terminal bracket and early decrements have no realized outcome. V1 supports small finite-population improvements for some schedules and retained TOP1 output, not recovery of this teacher or historical Steer Mean, and not general optimality of a timing strategy.",
